# energy is converted to keV; energy_mev retains the source energy in MeV.
# total includes coherent scattering; compton is incoherent scattering.
# pair is the sum of pair_nuclear and pair_electron, rounded to four significant figures.
# Other coefficient columns retain the precision of the NIST output.
